1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,890
KNIGHT: When I find him... he will pay.

2
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:09,840
JESUS: You've been gripping
that sword since sunrise, my friend.

3
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:13,280
JESUS: Why do you carry so much anger?

4
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:17,135
KNIGHT: The man I trusted
most betrayed me.

5
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:19,510
KNIGHT: He opened our gates to the enemy.

6
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:23,880
KNIGHT: Every day since...
I've sharpened this blade for him.

7
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:26,650
JESUS: Any man can defeat
his enemy with a sword.

8
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:30,185
JESUS: True strength is ruling
the anger inside you...

9
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,260
JESUS: and choosing what is right.

10
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:38,960
KNIGHT: So I'm supposed
to pretend it never happened?

11
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:43,180
JESUS: No. Forgiveness doesn't
pretend the wrong never happened.

12
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:47,680
JESUS: It means you refuse to let
hatred rule the rest of your life.

13
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:50,390
KNIGHT: I've let him rule me long enough.

14
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:55,660
JESUS: Then today...
you've won the greatest battle of all.
